Error [jet.CallOnFunctionValue]: This function value is called through `.call(…)`
  --> tests/ui/E0802_call_on_function_value.jet:4:23
    |
  4 |     print(make_adder().call(1))
    |                       ^^^^^
 Why: A function value is called with plain parentheses; `.call(…)` only selects a callable field that shares its name with a method
 Fix: Remove `.call` and write `callee(…)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0802
